//
// STATIC consumer asset (NOT regenerated by excel_to_dashboard.py), lazy-loaded
// by the inline boot in the tab shell on first activation of #tab-map-users.
//
// Manages the MAP platform's per-college user roster (MAP "College Users &
// Roles", category #9) so the team can keep it current + nudge colleges. The
// data is STAFF PII, so it lives only in the gated Supabase table
// public.map_college_users (synced by map/sync_map_users.py). This tab shows:
//   • DEFAULT (public, anon): per-college user COUNTS + the 7-way RoleName mix +
//     "data as of", via the SECURITY DEFINER map_users_summary() RPC. No PII.
//   • SIGNED-IN (magic-link reviewer OR shared team phrase — the same cpl_sb /
//     cpl_team_pass session as the Team & RACI tab): a per-college ROSTER drawer
//     with names + emails, gated server-side by is_allowed_reviewer() OR
//     team_pass_ok() (RLS on map_college_users — anon reads return nothing).
//
// Self-contained behind the CONFIG block (the cpl_news.js / cpl_chat.js
// pattern). Scoped CSS injected from JS so both HTMLs are covered without a
// Rule-4 mirror.
